# Every wave in turn on one held A3: P1 stepped through its 8 zones (pulse 12.5 / 25 / 50 %, duty cycling,
# triangle, saw, noise, metallic noise), two steps each, then the same at A5 with a vibrato (P2 31).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.5
track lead
preset 0 0 0 0 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p1 32 2
param p1 64 4
param p1 96 6
param p1 128 8
param p1 160 10
param p1 192 12
param p1 224 14
param p1 0 16
param p2 31 16
param p1 32 18
param p1 64 20
param p1 96 22
param p1 128 24
param p1 160 26
param p1 192 28
param p1 224 30
note 0 A3 16 127
note 16 A5 16 127
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 42
expect peak_below -6      # one voice peaks at -12 dBFS; a releasing note overlaps the next
